   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "A bit tired today, but okay.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I broke my arm on Wednesday and now my whole weekend is ruined.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Oh no, I'm sorry. How are you feeling?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Sore and fed up. I was supposed to go kayaking.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's rotten luck. Could you still go along with your friends and enjoy the riverbank, maybe with a picnic?",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Maybe. I'd feel left out though.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.38,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Fair. Then maybe a cinema trip, or have friends over for a film and takeaway.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I could watch that",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg13"
  },
  {
